I always go with SDSM simply because there are so many sources of MR. 
The cloak is a very nice source, with the lvl-3 cancellation, and if you 
really want the robe for casting it's almost the same to take off the 
cloak and put on the robe, but even that's not often necessary. Also, 
many artifacts give magic resistance as well as other bonuses, but if 
you don't like wishing for them I guess it might not be so easy.

What if you get hit by a bolt of lightning while your wand of death is 
out of the bag? It'll kill you even with magic resistance. I'd rather 
never have to be without MR or reflection.


